      title: "The controlled operator pilot account scope changes",
      narrative:
        "During pre-kickoff the deal team expected the controlled operator pilot to cover a set of no-partner healthcare accounts. Legal review then excludes two of them, and one further account is found to have an incumbent partner engagement that cannot be displaced at this phase. The pilot population shrinks and its mix changes. The correct response is not to adjust the revenue number in isolation — the program definition has moved, so every dependent page must be reconciled before the case is presented again.",
